  <History Date="11-10-22" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (poor documentation.  11 channel mode has 'Function' on channel 1 and 'Dimmer' on channel 2.  Assuming this is incorrect and is dimmer on 1 and shutter on 2)" Version="0" />
